  "details": "Description\n\nAfter joining your friend's room, if you choose to go to another room, the menu list will show that the friend's room is set as a private room, but in reality, the friend's room is still an open room or a friend's room. This seriously affects the gaming experience.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nAfter joining a friend's room, if you then choose to visit another room and try to view the friend's room again, it will show as a private room status and requires an application to join. However, in reality, the status of the friend's room has not changed. This is a very serious bug that affects the gaming experience. This bug did not exist before the update of the UI.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: 用户界面\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2-1901-4a7d603ee0-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-02_14-12-17.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_cbc0d480-84f8-4058-b2b7-cfbdb7ac394a/1/file)",
